                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Saloon Showdown VR is an arcade shooter that has been in early access for almost 5 years now.\n\nCheck out my gunslinging action here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7LbzDyGhyMI\n\nIn the game you will have to cover a route with points where you have to defend yourself from cowboys who attack you from all directions,\nat these points you will also be able to hide behind objects or buildings.\nthe game is quite simple, shoot everyone and survive till the end because when you die you start all over again.\nFor this price it's still entertaining, and a pleasant shooting game for VR newcomers, although there are better ones out there anyway.",
